@@ -337,6 +337,12 @@ immutable source permalink. The value is `null` when the environment variable
 is absent; runtime metadata never depends on `.git` being present in a Docker
 image.
 
+Every `run_meta.json` records `exit_reason`: `GAME_WIN`, `ACTION_BUDGET`,
+`TIME_BUDGET`, `SCORECARD_CLOSED`, `API_ERROR`, `AGENT_ERROR`, or `UNKNOWN`
+while a run is in progress or after a stop that recorded no ending. The agent
+writes it when its loop ends, including before an error propagates, and
+rewrites it when the swarm reclassifies an ending after closing the scorecard.
+
